      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 KPI ANOMALY WATCHDOG\n**What it does:** Reads your business KPIs from Google Sheets every morning → a Code node computes a 7-day baseline + z-scores and day-over-day change per metric → detected anomalies are logged to an audit sheet (`NEW`) → an AI Agent explains each anomaly (probable causes + what to check) → sheet flips to `TRIAGED` → severity routing: `CRITICAL` fires an instant Telegram alert, `WARNING` joins one daily digest, `WATCH` stays logged for your weekly review.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credentials\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `NEW` → `TRIAGED` → `RESOLVED`\n**Stats detect, agent explains:** the AI is only called on detected anomalies, so your OpenAI spend stays tiny.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 3900,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "8c3d866b-af7c-426a-90a7-9514877aa3cd",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
