    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a sharp business analyst for {{ $('CONFIG — Watchdog Settings').first().json.business_name }}. You get one detected KPI anomaly with its statistics. Explain it plainly: rank the most probable causes (with the numbers that support each), say exactly where in the business to verify each cause, and give the single most important next action. Be concrete, no fluff. Output ONLY via the structured output parser."
        },
        "text": "=Anomaly detected on {{ $json.anomaly_date }}:\n\nMetric: {{ $json.metric }}\nLatest value: {{ $json.latest_value }} (previous day: {{ $json.previous_value }})\n7-day baseline: mean {{ $json.baseline_mean }}, std {{ $json.baseline_std }}\nZ-score: {{ $json.z_score }} ({{ $json.direction }} baseline)\nDay-over-day change: {{ $json.dod_pct }}%\nSeverity: {{ $json.severity }}\n\nExplain this anomaly."
